                "text": "Seniors wait on average 5-6 years from when the FDA authorizes a breakthrough technology until Medicare actually covers it. I\u2019m leading legislation that ensures our most innovative devices have a clear roadmap to Medicare coverage so our seniors can reap the benefits sooner. https://t.co/bqRDqd6zRF",
