                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I convened my Debt and Deficit Task Force in Ogden to discuss the budget reconciliation bill, tariffs, healthcare, and other legislation impacting our national debt. Maintaining regular involvement with this group of constituents, stakeholders, and Utah businesses is essential for receiving candid feedback on how organizations are navigating ongoing policy changes. I was also glad to invite Will Burger from @AFPhq, who highlighted some wins from the OBBB and updated the task force on AFP\u2019s upcoming projects.",
