                "text": "Republicans in Congress are making the single largest investment in rural healthcare in American history with the Rural Health Transformation Fund. \n\nThis $50 billion investment will strengthen rural communities by improving healthcare access, quality, and outcomes. We\u2019re supporting rural health innovations, helping rural providers, and ensuring care for vulnerable populations.",
