                "text": "Medicare patients deserve swift access to life-changing breakthrough medical innovations. This piece in @Deseret from Kelvyn Cullimore of BioUtah does a great job outlining this need. My Ensuring Patient Access to Critical Breakthrough Products Act addresses this very issue! Read here:\n\nhttps://t.co/MgObvvtwKN",
